{#
  module/Schoenstatt/view/schoenstatt/schoenstatt/wayside-shrines.phtml, ported.

  Two templates now render this page: this one under the Symfony front controller
  (the capsule) and the .phtml under the laminas one (production). Both are live
  until SYMFONY_KERNEL is set in production; see docs/strangler.md.

  The .phtml is a copy of shrines.phtml with three things removed — the licence
  paragraph, the link to the wayside index (this *is* it) — and the API link
  pointed at the other association kind. Everything it kept is
  schoenstatt/_shrine-index.html.twig here, so this file is the difference and
  nothing else.

  Note that the schema.org datasets are the *shrine* ones, not wayside ones:
  waysideShrinesAction() calls the same getShrineDatasets() as shrinesAction(), so
  both pages publish the same two Dataset descriptions. Reproduced rather than
  corrected — see App\Schoenstatt\ShrineDatasets.

  On the sentences being whole strings and on `|e|format(…)|raw`, see the header
  comment of schoenstatt/shrines.html.twig: the same reasoning applies here.
#}
{% extends 'schoenstatt/_shrine-index.html.twig' %}

{% block shrine_header %}
{% set photos_note ="Do you have shrine photos to submit? See our %sphoto submission process%s." %}
{% set columns_note = "Until 2019-10-18, this page will be oriented towards data-maintainers and therefore show the columns of pertinent information." %}
{% set photos_url = laminas_path('shrines/submitting-photos') %}
<h1>{{ translate('Schoenstatt Wayside Shrines') }}</h1>

<p>{{ translate(photos_note)|e|format('<a href="' ~ photos_url|e ~ '">', '</a>')|raw }}
<p>{{ translate(columns_note) }}</p>
{% endblock %}
